        <body>
            <div xml:id="d530">

                <pb facs="0873" n="737" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg737"/>

                <head>No. 530.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 7, 1888</date>.
                        (Received July 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 795.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your instruction numbered 895,
                    of June 18, I have the honor to inclose the copy of a note which I addressed to
                    the Marquis of Salisbury, and that of his lordship’s reply to the same.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. J. Phelps.</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d530-a1.xml" xpointer="d530-a1"/>
